The relatively newer side of the Serralles "Gramas DelSur" Business is the Finca delPalmas Ornamentales-
or Ornamental Palm Farm
They have a good variety of popular landscape palms, just not as much quantity at this time, while they are
continuing to expand.
Currently there are roughly a little over 25 acres planted with over 11 varieties of Ornamental Palms

-Ornamental Palms, (Bismark, Date, Eureka, Foxtail, FishTail, Robalini, Triangle, Bottle, Spindle, Royal)


